<title>GERMANY: Krones appoints new supervisory head.</title>
<headline>Krones appoints new supervisory head.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German beverage and bottling machinery maker Krones AG said on Saturday that it had named Lorenz Raith as the new head of its supervisory board.</p>
<p>Krones said its founder, Hermann Kronseder, had stepped down from the position for health reasons.</p>
<p>It said Kronseder would continue with the firm in an advisory capacity.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
